<STYLE ID="7">"Ghaaah...!"</STYLE>
{QUAKESTOP "500"}
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">But something slammed into my chest faster than the eye could see, and blood gushed from my mouth all at once.</STYLE>
