<BR>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CREATECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\七海荘思い出.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{CREATECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\詫言編　始まり以降\美冬ハンマー.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "R" "B" "0" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
"Oh my, did that burst your lungs? This drug really is something. 
{PAUSE ""}
