{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="7">"Ngh...! Hack!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">I tried to breathe, but my lungs wouldn't move and no air came in.</STYLE><PG>
