{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">And without a pause, </STYLE>Mifuyu-san<STYLE ID="2"> grabbed the hair of </STYLE><STYLE ID="1">Akane</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">, who was now only a head, and pressed her against </STYLE><STYLE ID="3">Natsumi</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">.</STYLE><PG>
